:''For the old version, see [[A Colossal Valentine's]].''
'''Attack of the Lonely Hearts''' (強襲！義理チョコ軍団, ''Kyōshū！ Giri Choko Gundan'', '''Obligation Choco Army Assault!''') is a Valentine's stage added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features enemies from the [[A Colossal Valentine's]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
Attack of the Lonely Hearts contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Pity Gift''' (義理 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Pity Gift can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Attack of the Lonely Hearts/Pity Gift Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*War on Valentines is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.

